{"title": "Heavy Supply Pack", "pageid": 30692, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heavy_Supply_Pack", "categories": ["Food", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Heavy_Supply_Pack_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Heavy_Supply_Pack_Faded.png/300px-Heavy_Supply_Pack_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/8/8b/Heavy_Supply_Pack_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Heavy Supply Pack image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Heavy_Supply_Pack_Faded.png/300px-Heavy_Supply_Pack_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Heavy_Supply_Pack_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Heavy Supply Packs</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">consumable</a> item that can be used as <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a> to initiate <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rests</a>. It is a better variant of the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Supply_Pack\" title=\"Supply Pack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Supply_Pack_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Supply_Pack_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Supply_Pack_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Supply_Pack_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Supply_Pack_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Supply_Pack_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Supply_Pack_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Supply_Pack_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Supply_Pack_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Supply_Pack\" title=\"Supply Pack\">Supply Pack</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A sturdy bag filled to the brim with bread, vegetables, meats, and anything you need for a good night's sleep.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies#Food\" title=\"Camp Supplies\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Food_Icon.png/25px-Food_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Food_Icon.png/38px-Food_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Food_Icon.png/50px-Food_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Food\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Food_Icon.png/25px-Food_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Food_Icon.png\" clas